ssue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.7\n- Not reproducible in 4.6.2\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10\n\n### Issue description\n\n4.7 introduced `GDType`. `GDType::bind_integer_constant` and `GDType::add_signal` enforce registration to be on the main thread for some reason:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/56d440ff546f1a4bf3a120d7136969f11964aea3/core/object/gdtype.cpp#L75\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/56d440ff546f1a4bf3a120d7136969f11964aea3/core/object/gdtype.cpp#L116\n\nThis causes issues with libgodot when using `GDEXTENSION_INITIALIZATION_CORE` as the initialization will happen between `Main::setup` and `Main::setup2`\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/56d440ff546f1a4bf3a120d7136969f11964aea3/platform/windows/libgodot_windows.cpp#L46-L52\n\nwhere there is not main thread due to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/56d440ff546f1a4bf3a120d7136969f11964aea3/main/main.cpp#L2922\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- use libgodot\n- try to register a constant or signal in `GDEXTENSION_INITIALIZATION_CORE`\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121083/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121083/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}